# Frontend Portal Conventions

Each portal must provide:

- App Router + TypeScript + Tailwind + shadcn/ui (via `@dripplex/ui`)
- Authentication layout and dashboard layout
- `loading.tsx`, `error.tsx`, and `not-found.tsx`
- Responsive layout and dark mode support

## Rules

- No business rules in components — call services via `@dripplex/sdk` / server actions that delegate to the API.
- Forms: React Hook Form + Zod.
- Server/async state: TanStack Query.
- Client UI state: Zustand only when local/component state is insufficient.
- Reuse design tokens (spacing, typography, colors, radius, elevation, animation, icons) from `@dripplex/ui`.
- Never duplicate portal chrome (auth shell, nav, theme) if it belongs in `@dripplex/ui` or `@dripplex/hooks`.
- Strict TypeScript; no `any`.
